@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Quality Operator" as OPERATOR
participant ":System" as System
participant "WMS" as WMS
participant "Audit Log" as Log

activate OPERATOR

OPERATOR -> System : requests to process returned goods (returns.csv)
activate System
System --> OPERATOR : confirms returns successfully loaded

System -> WMS : load quarantine list (ordered by timestamp DESC, returnId ASC)
activate WMS
WMS --> System : returns list of items pending inspection
deactivate WMS

System -> WMS : inspect next return (latest first)
activate WMS
note right
  Inspection logic:
  • Reason = Customer remorse or Cycle count → Restock
  • Reason = Damaged or Expired → Discard
  • FEFO/FIFO insertion rules from USEI01 for restock
end note
WMS --> System : inspection result (Restock / Discard)
deactivate WMS

alt Restock
    System -> WMS : create new box (boxId="RET-"+returnId, receivedAt=now())
    activate WMS
    WMS --> System : box inserted into appropriate bay (FEFO/FIFO order)
    deactivate WMS
else Discard
    System -> WMS : mark item as discarded (not reintegrated)
    activate WMS
    WMS --> System : confirm discard
    deactivate WMS
end

System -> Log : write audit entry (timestamp, returnId, sku, action, qty)
activate Log
Log --> System : audit entry successfully recorded
deactivate Log

System --> OPERATOR : displays summary (Restocked/Discarded/Total processed)
deactivate System
deactivate OPERATOR

@enduml
